WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:10.097
Polly and Jack are running into my barn.

2
00:00:10.098 --> 00:00:16.322
I thought they were cleaning the farm today.

3
00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:18.749
Polly: Hi, Omar, we're here!

4
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.921
Jack: Hello!

5
00:00:21.922 --> 00:00:26.169
Omar: Don't you have chores around the farm?

6
00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:28.124
Polly: We'll finish them later.

7
00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:32.575
Jack: Minnie told Polly it was okay.

8
00:00:32.576 --> 00:00:35.899
What should we do today? Omar:

9
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:43.239
That pile of wood must be stacked. Polly:

10
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.616
We love working here! Omar:

11
00:00:45.617 --> 00:00:48.221
Is that true? Jack:

12
00:00:48.222 --> 00:00:51.832
I always tell the truth. Omar:

13
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.925
Good. What about you, Polly? Polly:

14
00:00:54.926 --> 00:00:59.840
Uh, yes. Omar:

15
00:00:59.841 --> 00:01:23.534
Hmm . . . It's important to tell the truth.

16
00:01:23.535 --> 00:01:30.677
Jack: The air is sparkling!

17
00:01:30.678 --> 00:01:34.539
Polly: We're in a woodworker's shop.

18
00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:38.503
Jack: Look at that fox puppet!

19
00:01:38.504 --> 00:01:47.786
Polly: Oh! It looks fun.

20
00:01:47.787 --> 00:01:52.243
Jack: Be careful, Polly.

21
00:01:52.244 --> 00:01:59.807
Polly: Don't worry. It will be fine.

22
00:01:59.808 --> 00:02:03.553
Jack: Huh? Did you hear that crack?

23
00:02:03.554 --> 00:02:09.816
Polly: I didn't hear anything.

24
00:02:09.817 --> 00:02:18.234
Jack: Hmm. I'll go check outside.

25
00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:29.570
Polly: Whew!

26
00:02:29.571 --> 00:02:37.427
Cat: I'm Cat. I'm here to pick up a fox puppet.

27
00:02:37.428 --> 00:02:46.188
Polly: Uh . . . Someone else bought it. Sorry, Cat!

28
00:02:46.189 --> 00:02:51.960
Cat: My boss isn't going to be happy!

